D[76856]={"^Your |cffffffffTormented Souls|r now creates 1 additional soul for each |cff5ee2ffReaped Soul|r active%.%s*$","Suas |cffffffffAlmas Atormentadas|r agora criam 1 alma adicional para cada |cff5ee2ffAlma Ceifada|r ativa."}
D[76857]={"^Increases the range of |cffffffffShudder Scythe|r is increased by (.-) yds and |cffffffffSoul Shock|r by (.-) yds%.%s*$","Aumenta em {{1}} m o alcance de |cffffffffFoice Trêmula|r e em {{2}} m o alcance de |cffffffffChoque de Alma|r."}
